*   **Landsat 8 OLI**: Offers **15-meter** spatial resolution. Its spectral bands are narrower: Red (640–670 nm, 30 nm width) and NIR (845–885 nm, 40 nm width). This provides higher spectral fidelity per pixel but lower spatial detail.
